<title>USA: Physician sees $25 mln/yr revs from pact.</title>
<headline>Physician sees $25 mln/yr revs from pact.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physician Corp of America (PCA) said Friday it had signed a two-year contract with one-year renewal options with the Puerto Rico Power Authority to cover approximately 45,000 members, with the contract expected to produce annual revenues of $25 million.</p>
<p>The contract is expected to deliver five percent pre-tax margins or between $0.01 and $0.02 per share, a statement from Physician Corp said.</p>
</text>
